#rule-box("The review loop")[
  Record the item number, the reason for the mistake and the correct principle. Revisit the relevant section before retrying; memorising an answer letter does not test understanding.
]

== H.1 A Practical Weekly Routine

+ *First session:* read the chapter, explain its diagram and write a brief summary without copying it.
+ *Second session:* work the examples, then attempt the drill under a time limit.
+ *Third session:* mark all answers, read every solution and classify errors as knowledge, interpretation or calculation errors.
+ *Later review:* retry missed ideas in a different order and check the current official subject requirements.
